  "question": {
    "text": "Calculate the half-life of the first-order reaction <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/>if the initial pressure of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is 80 mm and the total pressure at the end of 20 minutes is 120 mm."
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "40 min",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "120 min",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "20 min",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "80 min",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0005_68b79d6ede38.png\" style=\"width:4.1875in;height:0.85417in\"> <br/>According to the question, <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math> mm <br/>or <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math> mm <br/>or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></math> mm. <br/>For a first order reaction, <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>80</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></math> …(i) <br/>But we know that <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> …(ii) <br/>From equations (i) and (ii) <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math> min."
  }
